    doc = "Pip's performance: a 120-frame loop at 24 fps (frame 121 == frame 1). Only control avars, face dials, the four limb IKs' length offsets and the hat hand-off constraint are keyed; everything else is the rig. The limb poles and length offsets are computed per sample so every hose bows where the performance wants it and only swings through where customLayerData 'rubberhose:intendedBendChanges' says so (check_limbs.py verifies it). Generated by build_rubberhose.py."
